{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">肥媽在節目《今個夏天食平D》中，教大家炮製超邪惡的「炸芝士條」。這款人氣小食一口咬下去會呈現極致的拉絲效果，絕對令人食指大動！只需簡單5個步驟，再加上肥媽傳授的防漏餡秘訣，在家也能輕鬆炸出完美金黃的芝士條！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6bbe46d8-8b97-4810-b604-d7735ecbeb96.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026n09MSDvtxL1790239451.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6bbe46d8-8b97-4810-b604-d7735ecbeb96.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1e293a4f-e584-467b-a3b3-b5c18ca60c80.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Il7sXKM3nJ1790239451.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1e293a4f-e584-467b-a3b3-b5c18ca60c80.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">食材準備</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">番荽（Parsley，即洋人的芫荽）</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">麵包糠</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">麵粉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">雞蛋 1隻</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">油</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">簡單5步做法</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a18c2cbc-ba66-4a4e-a1e7-26da0d34e85d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026IdzuojTLdG1790239451.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a18c2cbc-ba66-4a4e-a1e7-26da0d34e85d.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d81f8bc5-9b2f-46da-a8a3-31a4d50040c6.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026g5NxwAw46c1790239452.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d81f8bc5-9b2f-46da-a8a3-31a4d50040c6.png.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">零失敗貼士</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T09:22:09.029575+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}